{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-p095a","title":"曹丕任陈群镇军司马懿抚军并定从征留守分职","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-p095a-account","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"曹丕任陈群镇军司马懿抚军并定从征留守分职","evidence":["wendi-e-p095a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"任命","evidence":["wendi-e-p095a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0394","role":"受任","evidence":["wendi-e-p095a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"受任","evidence":["wendi-e-p095a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":225,"label":"黄初六年二月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y225","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o049","basis":"黄初六年二月"},"evidence":["wendi-e-p095a-q","wendi-q-o049","wendi-q-b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-p095a-q","source_order":[2,486,"P095a"],"order":671}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0364","name":"司马懿","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0394","name":"陈群","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-p095a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-6b4f865e720cedb22a74","layer":"pei","quote":"其以尚书令、颍乡侯陈群为镇军大将军，尚书仆射、西乡侯司马懿为抚军大将军。若吾临江授诸将方略，则抚军当留许昌，督后诸军，录后台文书事；镇军随车驾，当董督众军，录行尚书事；皆假节鼓吹，给中军兵骑六百人。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":485,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6cda18de1792bc0666b0","start":135,"end":234,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：黄初六年（公元 225）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":467,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-61512c4ade75d71d6a76","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o049","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-d5847039c2d504d36e8e","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月〖1〗，遣使者循行许昌以东，尽沛郡〖2〗。问民所疾苦，贫者赈贷之。﹝一﹞三月，行幸召陵〖3〗，通讨虏渠〖4〗。乙巳〖5〗，还许昌宫。并州刺史梁习讨鲜卑轲比能〖6〗，大破之。辛未〖7〗，帝为舟师，东征。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
